Description: Edukasaun Desktop 0.9.13 - Stability and Session Repair
 Edukasaun Desktop, Eduka-Menu, Eduka-Menu Settings, and Eduka-Panel.
 Fixes the 0.9.12 session launcher that hid LXQt's default configuration
 (window manager chooser, broken theme), makes Eduka-Desktop the SDDM and
 LightDM default session, restores the transparent theme from Eduka-Menu
 Settings, and adds a smarter, event-driven Eduka-Panel with redesigned
 Sound and Network popups and an Action Center that takes over the tray.
